title: "k-shortest-path: k shortest paths in C#, Go and Rust"
abstract: >-
  Eppstein's k shortest paths algorithm with lazily built persistent heaps, simple paths with
  Yen's algorithm and Lawler's improvement, a detour bound, arc flags and a contraction hierarchy
  with PHAST, in C#, Go and Rust with identical interfaces and results.
